@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/objectives

### Creare objective 1 pt user1
POST {{baseUrl}}/objectives
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lansare MVP DayByDayPro",
  "description": "Finalizarea backend-ului Spring Boot si conectarea cu frontend-ul",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-15T23:59:00",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "ownerId": 1
}

### getAll user objectives
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/user/1

### findById
GET {{baseUrl}}/objectives/1

### Update objective
PUT {{baseUrl}}/objectives/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lansare MVP DayByDayPro v1.0",
  "description": "Include autentificare JWT si deploy",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-20T23:59:00",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

